WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:02.720
Yes, honey!

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.920
Life don't get any better than this.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:09.200
Twelve strangers
are about to compete

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.520
for a life-changing cash prize.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.600
I've never seen anything like this.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.480
We're not in Oklahoma anymore.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.520
They think
they'll be living a life of luxury…

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.880
This is literally paradise.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.800
…but there's one catch.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.520
Oh, wait.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.280
Oh, crap. What is going on?

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.440
I'm sorry, what?

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.480
In this game,
everyone starts with nothing.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.480
Is that the bathroom?

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.120
This is so awful.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.120
Did I sign up for Fyre Festival?

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.840
I don't believe I did.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:42.520
Alliances will get you
into paradise…

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.480
-I'm here with y'all, seriously.
-Absolutely.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.240
-No backstabbers?
-No backstabbers.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.280
I wanna be in that villa.
I wanna be on top.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:51.760
…but enemies
can send you back to hell.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.680
You got a target on you now.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.800
-It's about to get really juicy.
-Really?

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:57.400
I need people to vote for me.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.240
The only way
to get back into that villa.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.000
Who are these two newbies?

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:04.600
Nobody's safe. The games begin.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:09.960
We might even be pitted
against each other.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.600
I would never have done that to you.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.840
Something scandalous
is happening.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.600
Whatever I have to do, I will do.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.040
We need to have
a moment of silence

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.040
for our friends back at camp.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:22.560
And eat. Let's go.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.840
This is a brutal game.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:27.880
I am telling you right now,
do not take this box.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.400
No disrespect. I just don't like you.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.920
You're not gonna sit here
and tell me my emotions

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.000
are an act.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:35.720
Welcome to paradise.

